  "id": "split-brain",
  "term": "split brain",
  "definition": "Split brain is a condition or preparation in which the corpus callosum, the main connection between the brain’s hemispheres, has been completely severed. In humans this is usually done as a procedure for severe epilepsy that has not responded to medical treatment, and similar preparations are also used in animal research.",
